  "commit_message": "Merge commit from fork\n\n* Fix PNG interlaced sub-byte scanline over-read\n\nTryScaleUpTo8BitArray took a separate byte count. The interlaced caller\npassed bytesPerScanline for a span of bytesPerScanline - 1 bytes, so the\nloop read one byte past the scanline buffer for 1, 2 and 4-bit images.\n\nThe method now reads source.Length bytes, so the span bounds every read.\nThe interlaced path also passes only the scanline of the current Adam7\npass, as the non-interlaced path does.\n\nAdds a test allocator tha",
